                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Certainly not for everyone and quite short. Can be 'finished' in 30-60 minutes but not really the aim of the game either. If looking for something to help unwind after a long day, Gathering Sky just might fit the bill. Gameplay involved adding to your flock while exploring the skies along the paths of migration. Birds were controlled simply by a mouse click.  Do feel the price could be lower but the orchestral soundtrack and how it's timed to in-game events was mesmerizing. Enjoyed \"Ephemerid\"? Should know what to expect. If you didn't? Might want to wait. Cheers.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCGX8RgeFkA",
